          "_name": "features037",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features037\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Subtitle\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>美食經驗</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">我很喜歡吃美食，平常也很喜歡跟朋友一起找新的餐廳踩點，吃到好吃的會很有成就感，以下是我推薦的美食!<br><div><br></div></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-6 item-mb active\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>01.</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>阿裕牛肉涮涮鍋</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">地址:台南市仁德區崑崙街733-1號<br><br>鮮嫩牛肉往滾燙的高湯裡輕涮幾秒，趁肉質還帶著淡淡夢幻粉紅時送入口中，就是最完美的賞味時刻！台南溫體牛帶有一種扎實的咬勁，越咀嚼肉香越是爆發，真的超涮嘴！&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://share.google/jin03TnW4DtmosS1B\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">了解更多</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-6 item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>02.</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>萬昌起義</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">地址:台南市中西區民族路二段57巷5號2樓\n<br>\n<br>有特色的酒單跟氛圍，無菸味又不會太喧鬧，調酒溫柔順口無重酒精感，而且他們家炸物也神級好吃，邊嗑炸物邊喝調酒簡直太快樂！<br></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://share.google/KJSHDas7KBUotryti\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">了解更多</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-6 item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>03.</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>客林家庭式義大利餐廳</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">地址:台中市西屯區西安街277巷25弄31號<br>\n<br>不管是香濃義大利麵、靈魂燉飯還是現烤披薩通通有，每一道都能吃到實打實的滿滿好料。店內走的是溫暖療癒的鄉村風，在這裡優閒吃頓飯簡直太放鬆！&nbsp;<br></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://share.google/3E2rp9IchfnymupIm\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">了解更多</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-6 item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-content align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>04.</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>食足早午餐</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">地址:台中市西屯區西安街277巷25弄31號<br>\n<br>食足早午餐品項多到誇張，拼盤、漢堡、吐司、蛋餅隨你挑，套餐單點自由度超高。重點是價格親民到爆，高 CP 值大碗滿滿，完全就是學生族的神級拯救食堂！</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://share.google/PoGvNAp5Ngmwt1jAr\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">了解更多</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
